==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Corsola}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Galarian Corsola|117}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion; both cards have the Tackle attack.
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Galarian Corsola can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

